From ec425f0242d574dcb2216b30c03f8ea3b1933bb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 03:18:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign Team & Access: numbered cards, dealer search,
 sortable searchable grant picker, and a real access-history log
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a dealer search box and numbered dealer cards to the Team &
Access screen; the "+ Grant access" picker now has its own search box
over the already-sorted staff list, with a cleaner avatar + name +
role row layout. Adds a "History" toggle per dealer showing every
past grant/revoke event.

History needed a new append-only dealer_access_history table plus a
get_dealer_access_history() RPC — the existing dealer_access_grants
table only ever holds current state (a re-grant after a revoke resets
granted_at/revoked_at on the same row via its ON CONFLICT clause), so
it can't answer "what happened, when" on its own. grant_dealer_access()
and revoke_dealer_access() now also insert one history row per event.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
